        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Endscape: White Imperial Sword.</em> Every blade condenses into a single white sword; wings and a vertical halo open behind you.</p><p><strong>One creature within reach.</strong> Make a Strike; on a hit it takes the Waning dice as <strong>slashing</strong> damage.</p><p>This <strong>ignores all resistances and immunities</strong>. On a hit the target can't regain Hit Points, and its regeneration and fast healing are suppressed, for 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
